      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i get what ur saying but i literally cant afford an er bill right now and im just so tired of being sick. its just so sudden and weird, but like, if i just take a few more of my migraine meds and try to sleep it off, i'll know if it was nothing if i wake up feeling better tomorrow, right? i'm basically just looking for some reassurance that i'm not overthinking this. is it really that huge of a deal if it's just a really intense migraine?",
